<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce and Canon jointly launch copier.</title>
<headline>Oce and Canon jointly launch copier.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Photocopier maker Oce-van der Grinten NV said on Monday it and Canon Europa NV had reached agreement on the marketing of a new Canon high volume copier which will be based on Oce 2600 technology.</p>
<p>&quot;The new Canon copier, the NP 9100, will be available for the European market from mid 1997,&quot; Oce said in a statement.</p>
<p>Oce, which has been cooperating with Canon since 1990, added that the introduction of this new copier marks a new European wide co-operation between the two companies.</p>
<p>&quot;Oce welcomes this extension to the existing co-operation,&quot; Oce said.</p>
